Zurich's counters (zurich-counters), version 1
==============================================

The scripts in this folder are under this repository's Apache-2.0 licence.
The data the template carries is not: it stays under its sources' terms,
below.

Sources, licences and credits, as the template's facts and its map's note
carry them:

- Daten der automatischen Fussgänger- und Velozählung, Viertelstundenwerte, Stadt Zürich, CC0-1.0: Stadt Zürich, Tiefbauamt, Open Data Zürich
- Standorte der automatischen Fuss- und Velozählungen, Stadt Zürich, CC0-1.0: Stadt Zürich, Open Data Zürich


Daten der automatischen Fussgänger- und Velozählung – Viertelstundenwerte
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dataset: counts (828,507 quarter-hour counts at 28 counters in 2025)

Publisher: the City of Zurich's civil engineering office (Tiefbauamt,
Tiefbau- und Entsorgungsdepartement), on the city's open data portal.
https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch/dataset/ted_taz_verkehrszaehlungen_werte_fussgaenger_velo

Licence: Creative Commons CC0 1.0 (CC0-1.0), as the dataset's catalogue
record states it ("cc-zero", "Creative Commons CCZero").

Credit: the licence asks for none; the template names the source as
"Stadt Zürich, Tiefbauamt, Open Data Zürich".

Where and when: read on 2026-10-12 from the portal:

  https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch/api/3/action/package_show?id=ted_taz_verkehrszaehlungen_werte_fussgaenger_velo
  (the catalogue record, with the licence)
  https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch/dataset/ted_taz_verkehrszaehlungen_werte_fussgaenger_velo/download/2025_verkehrszaehlungen_werte_fussgaenger_velo.csv
  (the year 2025, 37,626,822 bytes, SHA-256 193141ff23c9d1da05d65e0e6980d92670c1657a5c051fe0c0c5e5fd7179c4ce)

Kept: for each quarter hour, the counter, its start in Zurich's local time
as the city writes it, whether the counter counts bicycles or
pedestrians, the passages each way, and both ways added up. Left out: the
counter's coordinates (the counters dataset carries the place). This is a
modified version of the data.


Standorte der automatischen Fuss- und Velozählungen
---------------------------------------------------

Dataset: counters (the 28 counters that counted in 2025)

Publisher: the City of Zurich (Tiefbauamt, Grundlagen + Strategien), on
the city's open data portal and its geodata service.
https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch/dataset/geo_standorte_der_automatischen_fuss__und_velozaehlungen

Licence: Creative Commons CC0 1.0 (CC0-1.0), as the dataset's catalogue
record states it ("cc-zero", "Creative Commons CCZero").

Credit: the licence asks for none; the template names the source as
"Stadt Zürich, Open Data Zürich".

Where and when: read on 2026-10-12:

  https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch/api/3/action/package_show?id=geo_standorte_der_automatischen_fuss__und_velozaehlungen
  (the catalogue record, with the licence)
  https://www.ogd.stadt-zuerich.ch/wfs/geoportal/Standorte_der_automatischen_Fuss__und_Velozaehlungen?SERVICE=WFS&REQUEST=GetFeature&VERSION=1.1.0&TYPENAME=view_eco_standorte&outputFormat=application/vnd.geo%2Bjson
  (175 site records, 81,055 bytes, SHA-256 385c9b56cd38a11f16d7b1fa97b7cd246bc336f7a4e10572207fe111de8bb25c)

Kept: for each counter in the 2025 counts, the name and the two
directions of the site record at its place (the register keeps a site's
earlier records beside its current one; the current one is taken), and
the place itself, from the counts' Swiss grid coordinates (LV95) turned
into longitude and latitude. This is a modified version of the data.


